---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import outside from '../assets/images/outside.webp';
import brickWall from '../assets/images/brick-wall-texture.jpg';
---

<section id="prica" class="relative scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden bg-stone-50 md:grid md:grid-cols-2">
  <div class="relative order-2 flex items-center px-6 py-20 md:order-1 md:px-14 md:py-28 lg:px-20">
    <Image
      src={brickWall}
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
      style="scale: 1.03;"
      data-scroll-scale-image
      data-scroll-scale-base="1.03"
      data-scroll-scale-amount="0.08"
      widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
      sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw"
      quality={45}
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-stone-50/88"></div>

    <div class="reveal relative text-center md:text-left" x-intersect.once="$el.classList.add('is-visible')">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brick-600">Naša priča &middot; Our story</p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-normal text-sea-900 md:text-5xl" x-show="$store.lang.current === 'hr'">
        Otkud ime &bdquo;Mizarola&ldquo;
      </h2>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-normal text-sea-900 md:text-5xl" x-cloak x-show="$store.lang.current === 'en'">
        Where the name &ldquo;Mizarola&rdquo; comes from
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 text-[22px] leading-[1.5] text-stone-800" x-show="$store.lang.current === 'hr'">
        „Mizarola” je drvena bačva koju je magarac nekoć nosio na leđima kroz vinograde Sućurja, napunjena vodom za obitelji koje su radile u polju. Magarac na našem logotipu čuva tu uspomenu i podsjeća nas da hranu i piće poslužujemo onako kako se to činilo generacijama.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[22px] leading-[1.5] text-stone-800" x-cloak x-show="$store.lang.current === 'en'">
        A mizarola is the wooden barrel a donkey once carried on its back through the vineyards of Sućuraj, filled with water for the families working in the fields. The donkey on our logo keeps that memory alive and reminds us to serve food and drink the way it's been done for generations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 order-1 h-[20rem] overflow-hidden md:order-2 md:h-auto md:min-h-[20rem]" x-intersect.once="$el.classList.add('is-visible')">
    <Image
      src={outside}
      alt="Konoba Mizarola, terasa i kamena fasada u Sućurju"
      class="block h-full w-full object-cover"
      widths={[480, 768, 1024]}
      sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw"
    />
  </div>
</section>
